OL,3,GGrampian                               
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening 
OL,6,Fwill be dry with some frost and fog    
OL,7,Fpatches. Then it will stay dry for the 
OL,8,Frest of the night but clouding over    
OL,9,Facross the east.                       
OL,11,CSaturday:FAfter a dry start cloud will 
OL,12,Fthicken with occasional light rain in  
OL,13,Fthe morning, likely to turn heavier in 
OL,14,Fthe afternoon, North Aberdeenshire     
OL,15,Fstaying dry for much of the day.       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
