OL,3,GGrampian                               
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright  
OL,6,Fand breezy with a few afternoon        
OL,7,Fshowers on Sunday. Mainly dry, mild    
OL,8,Fand windy on Monday but occasional     
OL,9,Frain in the south. Mainly dry and      
OL,10,Fbright on Tuesday.                     
